OL,3,GNEWSAStories from across Yorkshire to
OL,4,Amake you smile
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories about
OL,8,Fpeople, places and animals across our
OL,9,Fregion - and we like to shout about
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThis week we feature a missing cat
OL,13,Ffound 100 miles from home, a Doncaster
OL,14,Fgolfer winning the US Amateur
OL,15,FChampionship and a student running from
OL,16,FJohn O'Groats to Land's End.
OL,18,FAfter almost a year, the owner of a
OL,19,FGinge, a ginger cat was reunited with
OL,20,Fher beloved pet, after he was found
OL,21,Fover 100 miles (160km) away near Leeds.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
