OL,3,GNEWSAStories from across Yorkshire to
OL,4,Amake you smile
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy Roche, volunteer branch leader for
OL,7,Fcharity Cat Action Trust 1977, came
OL,8,Facross Ginge while caring for a feral
OL,9,Fcolony in Garforth and noticed he was
OL,10,Fvery tame.
